{{!-- Card video preview (the aspect-theme trick, ported).

Posts tagged #video-preview ship a hidden copy of their content
inside the card's media box; video-preview.js digs out the first
YouTube/Vimeo embed or video card, rewrites it into a muted
autoplaying loop, and lays it over the thumbnail — so the card
plays a silent preview where its image was.

On a gated post {{content}} is redacted, so html carries the
embed instead. words="12" keeps the copy small — cards survive
the truncation, paragraphs do not matter here.

Context: a post. Include INSIDE the .card-media element. --}}
{{#has tag="#video-preview"}}
    {{#if access}}
        <template data-video-preview>{{{content words="12"}}}</template>
    {{else if html}}
        <template data-video-preview>{{{html}}}</template>
    {{/if}}
{{/has}}
